<section class="section" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 id="approach-title">My approach to clear information</h2>
      <p>AccountOrbit's pages are built around three habits, so that you can judge what you read.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="deliver-grid">
      <article><h3>Separate the kinds of work</h3><p>Pages explain what a service involves, and which parts the law reserves for particular professionals.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Show where facts come from</h3><p>Tax and legal pages list the sources checked, say when they were checked, and say when a qualified person has not reviewed them.</p></article>
      <article><h3>State what is not in place</h3><p>Where a fact is not available yet, the page says so rather than filling the gap with a claim.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="ask-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 id="ask-title">Questions to ask before choosing a professional</h2>
      <p>These apply whoever you speak to, with or without AccountOrbit.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="deliver-grid">
      <article><h3>What work do I need help with?</h3><p>Write down the job first: books, a return, a notice or an audit. See <a href="/services/">services</a>.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Which professional is eligible to perform it?</h3><p>Some work is limited by law. See <a href="/guides/accountant-vs-chartered-accountant/">accountant vs Chartered Accountant</a>.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Who will actually handle the work?</h3><p>The person you meet may not be the person doing it, so ask who will.</p></article>
      <article><h3>What services are included in the scope?</h3><p>Ask what is included and what is not, in writing, before you agree.</p></article>
      <article><h3>How are fees and extra costs explained?</h3><p>Ask for the total, with GST and government charges shown. See <a href="/guides/accounting-services-cost-in-delhi/">accounting services cost in Delhi</a>.</p></article>
      <article><h3>What documents will I need?</h3><p>Knowing this early avoids delays. See the <a href="/guides/monthly-accounting-documents-checklist/">monthly documents checklist</a>.</p></article>
    </div>
    <p class="section-foot">For a fuller walk-through, read <a href="/guides/how-to-hire-an-accountant-in-delhi/">how to hire an accountant in Delhi</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

